Z||000008||Monkeyman||08-21-2000||08:41 PM||||Custom dash and center console.  Very basic design, but really trick.  Outside (and edges) covered in nice gray vinyl and the inside (inserts??) filled with some deep smoked Plexiglass/Lexan.  I want as much hidden as possible.  Something very stealth.  I thought that a bank of 6 or 7 of these little black switches mounted in a raised portion of the center console would be cool, but only if it would be durable.  I know know what I will do with my p/m switch, but if I can get (and get to work) little rocker switches, it would be a lot less noticeable than the stock ones.  I'll check out Grainger and Radio Shack tonight and see what they have to offer.<P>dog--what kind of stuff can you get???  Feel free to email me if you want.||||reg||1
